## State Machine Integration

### Condition Checking in Main Loop
```lua
-- Main execution loop with condition checking
State = CharacterState.ready
while not StopFlag do
    if not IsCharacterBusy() then
        State()
    end
    yield("/wait 0.1")
end
```

### Specific Condition Checking
```lua
-- Check specific conditions for state transitions
function Ready()
    -- Check if character is busy with specific conditions
    if Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.casting] or
       Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.betweenAreas] or
       Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.beingMoved] then
        return -- Don't change state if busy
    end
    
    -- Proceed with state logic
    if someCondition then
        State = CharacterState.working
    end
end
```

